      "description": "Watch Real Betis vs Real Sociedad highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 21, 2026. A Tactical Standoff On August 21, 2026, Real Betis and Real Sociedad locked horns in a La Liga fixture defined by tactical discipline and persistent midfield battles. Throughout the match, both sides fought for every inch of grass, creating an atmosphere of high tension that persisted until the very final whistle. The Breakthrough After a stalemate in the first half, the game’s defining moment arrived in the 63rd minute. Juan Hernandez delivered a precise ball to Rodrigo Riquelme , who hammered a clinical left-footed volley into the goal. This strike tilted the momentum in favor of the hosts, forcing the visitors to chase the game. Real Sociedad came agonizingly close to equalizing when Luka Sucic struck the post, but the woodwork denied them, keeping Real Betis in the lead. Defending the Lead As the clock ticked toward the end, the match grew increasingly physical, leading the referee to issue a flurry of yellow cards to both sides. Real Betis demonstrated excellent game management, repelling late pressure and ensuring that the crucial first-half defensive efforts were not in vain. The hosts held firm to secure a hard-fought victory, showcasing both clinical finishing and gritty determination."
